{
  "format": "sfxgen/1",
  "name": "Reload",
  "description": "A pistol reloaded in a quiet room, close to the microphone. 0 ms: a fresh magazine is slapped into the grip, a steel box seating in a polymer frame with a palm thump behind it. 260 to 400 ms: the slide is racked back, steel dragged over steel for 140 ms, its ridges slowing as the spring loads. 410 ms: let go, the slide slams home (the hardest, brightest hit) and its recoil spring twangs for a moment inside the frame.",
  "tags": ["weapon", "gun", "reload", "click", "pistol", "magazine", "slide", "rack", "mechanical", "foley"],
  "duration": "auto",
  "seed": 7,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "id": "magazine",
      "note": "Mag seating: a small steel box hit inside the grip. Dented and damped, because it is full of rounds and held in a hand.",
      "source": {
        "type": "modal",
        "material": "metal",
        "shape": "box",
        "freq": 720,
        "decay": 0.07,
        "damping": 2.2,
        "dent": 0.5,
        "position": 0.6,
        "variant": 5,
        "exciter": { "kind": "mallet", "hardness": 0.73 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "palm",
      "note": "The palm and the polymer frame taking the slap: the low part of the click, 2 ms late.",
      "start": 0.002,
      "gain": -5.7,
      "source": {
        "type": "modal",
        "material": "plastic",
        "shape": "box",
        "freq": 205,
        "decay": 0.08,
        "position": 0.3,
        "exciter": { "kind": "mallet", "hardness": 0.4 }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rack",
      "note": "The slide pulled back: a scrape with fairly regular ridges (machined rails), slowing. Quieter than the hits either side of it.",
      "start": 0.26,
      "gain": -5.2,
      "source": {
        "type": "modal",
        "material": "metal",
        "shape": "tube",
        "freq": 1150,
        "decay": 0.05,
        "damping": 1.5,
        "modes": 18,
